[
 {
  "id": "s01",
  "n": 1,
  "t": 3.5,
  "wide": 0.6,
  "text": "There was once a caterpillar who was climbing a staircase."
 },
 {
  "id": "s02",
  "n": 2,
  "t": 1.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "Nobody knew who had built it."
 },
 {
  "id": "s03",
  "n": 3,
  "t": 1.9,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "Nobody knew what was at the top."
 },
 {
  "id": "s04",
  "n": 4,
  "t": 2.4,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "move": [
   0,
   0.9,
   0
  ],
  "aim": [
   0,
   0.3,
   0
  ],
  "text": "But the older caterpillars told stories."
 },
 {
  "id": "h06",
  "n": 6,
  "t": 4.6,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "pos": "top",
  "text": "“Climb high enough,” they said,<br>“and you’ll become a butterfly.”"
 },
 {
  "size": 190,
  "text": "So he climbed.",
  "id": "c06",
  "n": 17.5,
  "t": 2.6,
  "wide": 0.8
 },
 {
  "id": "s07",
  "n": 8,
  "t": 1.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "He climbed past thousands of steps."
 },
 {
  "id": "q09s",
  "n": 9,
  "t": 1.9,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "shade": 0.35,
  "text": "Past caterpillars who had given up."
 },
 {
  "id": "s09",
  "n": 10,
  "t": 0.6,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "aim": [
   0,
   0.3,
   0
  ],
  "pos": "top",
  "text": "Past the skeletons of those who had died trying."
 },
 {
  "id": "s10",
  "n": 11,
  "t": 2.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "Some had left messages carved into the walls."
 },
 {
  "id": "w11",
  "n": 11,
  "t": 0.4,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "blocks": [
   {
    "text": "“Keep going.”",
    "box": [
     0.06,
     0.05,
     0.5,
     0.17
    ],
    "size": 118
   },
   {
    "text": "“The top is worth it.”",
    "box": [
     0.46,
     0.11,
     0.94,
     0.25
    ],
    "size": 118
   },
   {
    "text": "“You’re almost there.”",
    "box": [
     0.03,
     0.4,
     0.36,
     0.6
    ],
    "size": 118
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "One day, he came across a caterpillar coming down the staircase.",
  "id": "c12",
  "n": 16,
  "t": 1.0,
  "wide": 0.9
 },
 {
  "id": "s12",
  "n": 17,
  "t": 1.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "blocks": [
   {
    "text": "“What’s at the top?” he asked.",
    "box": [
     0.06,
     0.05,
     0.5,
     0.28
    ],
    "size": 128
   },
   {
    "text": "“Glory,” the caterpillar replied.",
    "box": [
     0.5,
     0.13,
     0.94,
     0.33
    ],
    "size": 128
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "blocks": [
   {
    "text": "“Have you seen it?”",
    "box": [
     0.58,
     0.05,
     0.94,
     0.3
    ],
    "size": 128
   },
   {
    "text": "“No. But I’ve heard.”",
    "box": [
     0.08,
     0.8,
     0.92,
     0.95
    ],
    "size": 128
   }
  ],
  "id": "c13",
  "n": 18,
  "t": 0.6,
  "wide": 0.9
 },
 {
  "id": "s14",
  "n": 21,
  "t": 1.2,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "size": 190,
  "text": "Years passed."
 },
 {
  "id": "s15",
  "n": 22,
  "t": 0.8,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "pos": "top-right",
  "text": "His body grew tired.<br>His legs grew weak."
 },
 {
  "id": "s16",
  "n": 24.5,
  "t": 1.0,
  "wide": 0.6,
  "text": "But he kept climbing,"
 },
 {
  "id": "k25",
  "n": 25,
  "t": 1.8,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "because the thought of staying a caterpillar scared him more than the staircase."
 },
 {
  "id": "k26",
  "n": 26,
  "t": 1.6,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "One day, he couldn’t take it anymore."
 },
 {
  "id": "s17",
  "n": 27,
  "t": 0.8,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "He stopped climbing and screamed at the top of his lungs.",
  "pos": "top"
 },
 {
  "id": "k28",
  "n": 28,
  "t": 2.8,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "Then, from somewhere above, a voice called out:"
 },
 {
  "id": "s18",
  "n": 29,
  "t": 1.5,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "aim": [
   0,
   0.35,
   0
  ],
  "pos": "top",
  "size": 128,
  "text": "“You’re almost there! Don’t give up now! You’ve come so far!”"
 },
 {
  "id": "s19",
  "n": 31,
  "t": 2.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "But this time, he noticed that every caterpillar was hearing the same voice."
 },
 {
  "id": "s20",
  "n": 32,
  "t": 2.9,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "And every single one of them was almost there."
 },
 {
  "id": "s21",
  "n": 33,
  "t": 1.3,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "He looked up at the endless staircase."
 },
 {
  "id": "k34b",
  "n": 34,
  "t": 1.2,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "move": [
   0.6,
   0.35,
   -0.5
  ],
  "text": "Then he looked at his little suitcase."
 },
 {
  "size": 190,
  "text": "And finally, he sat down.",
  "id": "c22",
  "n": 35,
  "t": 2.0,
  "wide": 0.9,
  "move": [
   -1.5,
   0.7,
   -2.2
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "s23",
  "n": 36,
  "t": 1.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "For a while, he waited."
 },
 {
  "text": "But nothing happened.",
  "id": "c38a",
  "n": 38,
  "t": 0.15,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "move": [
   0.38,
   0.31,
   -0.77
  ],
  "shade": 0.3
 },
 {
  "id": "s24",
  "n": 39,
  "t": 2.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "The staircase carried on as it always had."
 },
 {
  "id": "k41s",
  "n": 41,
  "t": 2.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "shade": 0.3,
  "text": "And he was still just a caterpillar.",
  "pos": "mid-left"
 },
 {
  "id": "s25",
  "n": 43,
  "t": 1.4,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "move": [
   0.4,
   0.25,
   -0.4
  ],
  "pos": "top",
  "text": "There were no wings."
 },
 {
  "id": "k44",
  "n": 44,
  "t": 1.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "And there was no glory."
 },
 {
  "id": "s26",
  "n": 45,
  "t": 4.5,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "move": [
   0.3,
   0.4,
   -0.7
  ],
  "text": "But for the first time in his life, he wasn’t miserable."
 },
 {
  "id": "k46",
  "n": 46,
  "t": 3.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "For the first time, he was just there.",
  "pos": "top-right"
 },
 {
  "size": 190,
  "text": "And that was enough.",
  "id": "c39",
  "n": 45,
  "t": 4.5,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "pos": "top"
 },
 {
  "id": "k49",
  "n": 49,
  "t": 1.6,
  "wide": 1.0,
  "text": "He looked up at the staircase once more, and wondered…",
  "move": [
   0.34,
   0.46,
   -0.7
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "s28",
  "n": 50,
  "t": 9.0,
  "wide": 0.8,
  "text": "What if the top was invented by caterpillars who couldn’t bear the thought that climbing was all there was?"
 }
]